<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13479] Both ignite.sh and control.sh use the same JVM_OPTS. Control.sh doesn&apos;t start if JMX port was set</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13479</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is no other way to set parameters for docker images, so, when you set JMX port to JVM_OPTS, you can&apos;t start control.sh:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Error: Exception thrown by the agent : java.rmi.server.ExportException: Port already in use: 49112; nested exception is:&lt;br/&gt;
java.net.BindException: Address in use (Bind failed)&lt;br/&gt;
sun.management.AgentConfigurationError: java.rmi.server.ExportException: Port already in use: 49112; nested exception is:&lt;br/&gt;
java.net.BindException: Address in use (Bind failed)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
